[2026-01-30T16:11:55.068Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_016oKfSX9DgRUtYZLuAwZ3db","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have successfully implemented the interactive contradiction explorer system. Here's a summary of what was created:\n\n## Summary of Implementation\n\n### Core Library:\n\n**`src/lib/contradictionResolution.ts`** - Core logic containing:\n- Severity classification algorithm (critical/high/medium/low)\n- Resolution strategy generation\n- Confidence impact simulation\n- Resolution persistence (localStorage)\n- Voting system utilities\n- History tracking\n\n### Hook:\n\n**`src/hooks/useContradictionExplorer.ts`** - State management for:\n- Enriched contradictions with context\n- Filtering and sorting\n- Resolution actions (status change, strategy selection, voting)\n- Confidence simulation\n- History retrieval\n\n### UI Components:\n\n1. **`ContradictionExplorer.tsx`** - Main container with list/detail split view\n2. **`ClaimComparison.tsx`** - Side-by-side claim comparison with differences highlighting\n3. **`SourceQualityCompare.tsx`** - Visual credibility comparison with gauges\n4. **`ResolutionSuggester.tsx`** - AI-powered strategy suggestions with voting interface\n5. **`ConfidenceImpactSim.tsx`** - What-if analysis showing confidence changes\n6. **`ResolutionTracker.tsx`** - Status management, notes, and activity history\n\n### API Route:\n\n**`src/app/api/contradictions/resolve/route.ts`** - Endpoints for:\n- `get_suggestions`: Generate AI resolution strategies\n- `save_resolution`: Persist resolution decisions\n- `get_resolution`: Retrieve stored resolutions\n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n\n- **Severity Classification**: Automatic scoring based on source credibility, confidence, dependencies\n- **Side-by-Side Comparison**: Visual claim comparison with metadata\n- **Source Quality Analysis**: Credibility gauges and factor comparison\n- **Resolution Strategies**: 8 strategy types with rationale and required actions\n- **Confidence Impact Simulation**: Visual before/after comparison with propagation tracking\n- **Team Voting**: Submit votes with confidence level and reasoning\n- **Status Tracking**: Unresolved, Investigating, Resolved, Dismissed states\n- **Activity History**: Timeline of all resolution events\n- **Notes System**: Add and persist notes for each contradiction\n- **Filtering & Sorting**: By status, severity, date, and search\n- **Theme Integration**: Full support for radar/swiss themes"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":492,"cache_read_input_tokens":162769,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":492},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb700aba-f9fc-4283-93cf-561e37220b63","uuid":"adf42d96-0e03-4f28-a02b-b507ca5515c6"}
